,"isActive":false},{"id":"seg-032","text":"其黄而隕","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-033","text":"自我徂爾","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-034","text":"三歲食貧","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-035","text":"淇水湯湯","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-036","text":"漸車帷裳","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-037","text":"女也不爽","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-038","text":"士貳其行","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-039","text":"士也罔極","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-040","text":"二三其德","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-041","text":"三歲爲婦","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-042","text":"靡室勞矣","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-043","text":"夙興夜寐","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-044","text":"靡有朝矣","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-045","text":"言既遂矣","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-046","text":"至于暴矣","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-047","text":"兄弟不知","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-048","text":"咥其笑矣","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-049","text":"静言思之","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-050","text":"躬自悼矣","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-051","text":"及爾偕老","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-052","text":"老使我怨","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-053","text":"淇則有岸","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-054","text":"隰則有泮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-055","text":"總角之宴","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-056","text":"言笑晏晏","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-057","text":"信誓旦旦","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-058","text":"不思其反","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-059","text":"反是不思","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-060","text":"亦已焉哉","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi","title":"诗经原始(上下)","authors":["方玉润","李先耕"],"contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","era":"清","publicationYear":1986,"carrier":"EPUB"},"stats":{"annotationCount":2,"glossCount":2},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":2,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"氓㊟爲棄婦作也。","targetNotes":"题注。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标题段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"题注"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":2,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"氓之蚩蚩，抱布貿絲，匪來貿絲，來即我謀，送子涉淇，至于頓丘，匪我愆期，子無良媒，將子無怒，秋以爲期。乘彼垝垣，以望復關，不見復關，泣涕漣漣，既見復關，載笑載言，爾卜爾筮，體無咎言，以爾車來，以我賄遷。桑之未落，其葉沃若，于嗟鳩兮，無食桑葚，于嗟女兮，無與士耽，士之耽兮，猶可説也，女之耽兮，不可説也。桑之落矣，其黄而隕，自我徂爾，三歲食貧，淇水湯湯，漸車帷裳，女也不爽，士貳其行，士也罔極，二三其德。三歲爲婦，靡室勞矣，夙興夜寐，靡有朝矣，言既遂矣，至于暴矣，兄弟不知，咥其笑矣，静言思之，躬自悼矣。及爾偕老，老使我怨，淇則有岸，隰則有泮，總角之宴，言笑晏晏，信誓旦旦，不思其反，反是不思，亦已焉哉。","targetNotes":"全篇通释。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"依据 EPUB《詩經原始》卷四《氓》条整理。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评"}]}]}}}
